    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm disappearing. i forgot my sister's birthday yesterday and i couldn't even remember the word for 'spoon' for like five minutes. it's like my brain is just... evaporating. i don't want to wait until i'm just a shell of a person who doesn't even know who they are. i just want to stop before there's nothing left of me.",
